{
  "title": "- Good morning, how can I help you?",
  "subtitle": "",
  "accent": "#e8590c",
  "background": "#0b0b12",
  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "- Good morning, how can I help you?",
      "startMs": 3480,
      "endMs": 5860,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- I don't feel well.",
      "startMs": 5860,
      "endMs": 7340,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- I'm sorry to hear that.",
      "startMs": 7370,
      "endMs": 9570,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "What's the matter?",
      "startMs": 10850,
      "endMs": 11550,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- I have a headache.",
      "startMs": 12374,
      "endMs": 13309,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Do you have a fever?",
      "startMs": 14616,
      "endMs": 15436,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- I think so.",
      "startMs": 16121,
      "endMs": 16821,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "And I have a cough.",
      "startMs": 17298,
      "endMs": 18057,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- How long have you felt this way?",
      "startMs": 21132,
      "endMs": 22866,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Since yesterday.",
      "startMs": 23249,
      "endMs": 24022,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you have a sore throat?",
      "startMs": 24598,
      "endMs": 25433,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Yes, a little.",
      "startMs": 26049,
      "endMs": 26773,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Okay.",
      "startMs": 27252,
      "endMs": 27640,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me check.",
      "startMs": 27640,
      "endMs": 28926,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- You should get some rest.",
      "startMs": 30357,
      "endMs": 31392,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Okay.",
      "startMs": 32003,
      "endMs": 32703,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Drink plenty of water.",
      "startMs": 34074,
      "endMs": 35086,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Should I stay home today?",
      "startMs": 35634,
      "endMs": 36575,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Yes, if you feel unwell.",
      "startMs": 37046,
      "endMs": 38423,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Take this medicine after meals.",
      "startMs": 40268,
      "endMs": 41846,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- How often should I take it?",
      "startMs": 42294,
      "endMs": 43706,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Twice a day.",
      "startMs": 44256,
      "endMs": 45020,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow the instructions on the package.",
      "startMs": 45020,
      "endMs": 46665,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Thank you, doctor.",
      "startMs": 47026,
      "endMs": 47860,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- You're welcome.",
      "startMs": 47860,
      "endMs": 48540,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Get well soon.",
      "startMs": 48540,
      "endMs": 49329,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- You have a headache and a fever.",
      "startMs": 50515,
      "endMs": 52132,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "What should you tell the doctor?",
      "startMs": 53243,
      "endMs": 54525,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The correct answer is A.",
      "startMs": 57498,
      "endMs": 60000,
      "audio": null
    },
    {
      "text": "- Chào buổi sáng, tôi giúp gì được cho bạn?",
      "startMs": 3480,
      "endMs": 5860,
      "audio": null,
      "style": {
        "font": "sans",
        "size": 54,
        "weight": 900,
        "color": "#ffd400",
        "accent": "#000000",
        "preset": "outline",
        "x": 50,
        "y": 89,
        "uppercase": false,
        "italic": false,
        "width": 86,
        "align": "center"
      },
      "track": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "- Tôi cảm thấy không khỏe.",
      "startMs": 5860,
      "endMs": 7340,
      "audio": null,
      "style": {
        "font": "sans",
        "size": 54,
